{
  "about": "Normalisation cases for AC-03 beyond the M-100 fixture: price units, the person-day of 8 hours for services (never SAP's 24-hour day), missing conversions, a currency without a rate, and every Incoterms 2020 rule (uplift only for groups E and F; none for a line without Incoterms). The engine suite adds every unit conversion and every currency of the world itself, at the bundled rates. Rates here: 1 GBP = 1.15 EUR; default parameters.",
